  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Joseph P. Meissner built a career across law, military service, education, and community advocacy. His work included legal service, teaching, veterans support, and civic engagement, while his Irish and German heritage ties shaped a public life committed to service, cross-cultural understanding, and Greater Cleveland's international communities."
